WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.120
Parents want their kids
to build with technology,

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:04.830
not just scroll through it.

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:07.510
When my younger brother
got a LEGO robot,

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:09.860
two weeks later it was in a drawer.

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:12.800
A box of robots alone doesn't teach.

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:15.830
Kids need a mentor, a group and a goal.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.300
Most centres hit the same wall:

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:21.370
no ready curriculum,
and no trained teachers.

00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:25.910
So we built Robotics Academy. Today
we teach more than ten thousand

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:29.620
kids a year, in Lithuania,
Ireland and the USA.

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:32.440
One path from age three to twelve:

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:36.360
Matata robots, LEGO, robotics
and Minecraft games,

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:37.710
then BrainClub.

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:40.950
Here is what a partner gets. One:

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:43.150
every lesson planned minute by minute,

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:45.100
with the exact kit list.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:48.540
Two: we train your teachers
before the first class,

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:50.770
the way we train our own mentors.

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:54.650
Three: ExoClass, our
own system for sign-ups,

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:56.120
payments and attendance.

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:58.640
We are a LEGO Education partner,

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:02.550
and BrainClub won Edu
Challenger Lithuania in 2025.

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:06.230
We start with one pilot
term. After a good pilot,

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:09.230
you get a licence to run our
programmes under our brand.

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.780
Fees and territory, we agree together.

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:14.920
We're looking for partner
centres in Singapore.

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:17.350
Email us, and let's build this together.
